Bundles a pinned dependency on NimContracts
(github.com/lbartoletti/NimContracts @ 881d6d1ac762b8179fa46da567e8fd41ff747d06),
MIT-licensed.

The symbology encoders are original code against public documented standards:
ISO/IEC 15438 (PDF417), ISO/IEC 18004 (QR Code), ISO/IEC 16022 (Data Matrix),
ISO/IEC 24778 (Aztec), ISO/IEC 16390 (ITF), ISO/IEC 15417 (Code 128),
ISO/IEC 16388 (Code 39), and GS1 for EAN/UPC. Where a table or algorithm was
verified against a permissive reference implementation, that source is credited
in the relevant file: zxing-cpp (Apache-2.0) and aztec_code_generator (MIT).
